{"rev":5,"ts":"2026-08-13T20:46:48.584552100+00:00","fields":{"__previous_part_content__":"- A documented Mermaid graph convention exists under `.agents/instructions/orchestration/`.\r\n- The convention specifies node labels as `<type> · <short-id>` on the first line and the ticket title on a following line.\r\n- The convention specifies Mermaid sizing and spacing directives that give node labels room without truncation or cramped titles.\r\n- The convention requires a legend block that distinguishes `depends_on` from `linked` edges.\r\n- The convention requires an explicit reading-direction statement and declares whether `depends_on` arrows use stored direction (`blocked → blocker`) or execution direction (`do-first → do-later`).\r\n- Agent templates that render ticket graphs reference the shared convention instead of duplicating its rules.","__previous_part_id__":"6e47548e-c923-49f5-8948-1b60bcd70adf","component":"agent-guidance","parts":[{"id":"6e47548e-c923-49f5-8948-1b60bcd70adf","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/6e47548e-c923-49f5-8948-1b60bcd70adf.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-08-13T19:59:59.335282900Z"},{"id":"aed6f0ed-f114-457e-932f-1d39f3c0bc64","kind":"decisions","path":"parts/aed6f0ed-f114-457e-932f-1d39f3c0bc64.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-08-13T20:46:13.190318500Z"},{"id":"d52be8cf-0f5a-481a-8313-b5896ed9aa4b","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/d52be8cf-0f5a-481a-8313-b5896ed9aa4b.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-08-13T20:46:18.601639200Z"}],"priority":"medium","risk_level":"low","state":"open","title":"Define mermaid graph rendering conventions for agent responses","type":"task"}}
